{"4627740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Death Standing", "steam_appid": 4627740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">MEDITATIVE ENDURANCE CHALLENGE GAME!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALL YOU DO IS HOLD THE LEFT MOUSE BUTTON. LONG TIME! </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">BUT DON'T MOVE THE MOUSE ITSELF! BABY WILL FALL!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: right\">FOR HARDCORE GAMERS ONLY. VERY DIFFICULT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death has come to take Hideous Kojira-san to the Underworld. However, the tricky old bugger has tricked Death itself by grabbing onto a falling baby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now Death has no choice but to wait for the baby to be dropped, as the baby has so much to live for still!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who's going to give up first? Will Kojira-san drop the baby? Or will Death wrap it up for the day and go home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Grab the baby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Do not drop the baby.「very difficult - easy to get distracted!」</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Wait till Death clocks out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Enjoy another day of living!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALSO FEATURING A LEADERBOARD FOR THE COMPETITIVE BABY HOLDERS OF THE WORLD!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627740/extras/81dfe602d31c3fc8e8f5407b8bb50abc.poster.avif?t=1785939070\" width=158 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627740/extras/81dfe602d31c3fc8e8f5407b8bb50abc.webm?t=1785939070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627740/extras/81dfe602d31c3fc8e8f5407b8bb50abc.mp4?t=1785939070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627740/extras/79efea1c293ad2a8482943822567658a.poster.avif?t=1785939070\" width=158 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627740/extras/79efea1c293ad2a8482943822567658a.webm?t=1785939070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627740/extras/79efea1c293ad2a8482943822567658a.mp4?t=1785939070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627740/extras/83ed2ef4076446691711d8cfd994cf3b.poster.avif?t=1785939070\" width=158 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627740/extras/83ed2ef4076446691711d8cfd994cf3b.webm?t=1785939070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627740/extras/83ed2ef4076446691711d8cfd994cf3b.mp4?t=1785939070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627740/extras/b7f0b6d633b518aaa15798ca419a886a.poster.avif?t=1785939070\" width=158 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627740/extras/b7f0b6d633b518aaa15798ca419a886a.webm?t=1785939070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627740/extras/b7f0b6d633b518aaa15798ca419a886a.mp4?t=1785939070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTRODUCING THE GRAND STAND! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A REVENUE-SHARE PROGRAM FOR THE PROFESSIONAL SINGLE-PLAYER BABY-HOLDING SCENE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10% OF THE DEATH STANDING REVENUE SPLIT AMONG THE TOP 3.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MORE DETAILS ON THE OFFICIAL DEATH STANDING WEBSITE LISTED ON THE SIDEBAR.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOW WITH CO-OP! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UP TO 3 FRIENDS CAN GRAB THE BABY LOCALLY, USING THE SAME MOUSE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OR UP TO 9 PEOPLE ONLINE. NO MATTER WHERE YOU ARE, YOU CAN STAND THE SAME.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627740/extras/c41bf54cdd1f3a03d9540385cbe826f4.poster.avif?t=1785939070\" width=1170 height=878 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627740/extras/c41bf54cdd1f3a03d9540385cbe826f4.webm?t=1785939070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627740/extras/c41bf54cdd1f3a03d9540385cbe826f4.mp4?t=1785939070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Many industry experts are calling &quot;Death Standing&quot; one of the hardest games ever made. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;After playing Death Standing, I realized I had no choice but to give my copy of Dark Souls to my 5-year-old nephew, as he seemed to be a more suitable audience. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>I wish I had known what true gaming difficulty is like sooner!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;In our over-stimulated society, it's not difficult to press a bunch of inputs quickly, it's painless! But to sit still and rest?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627740/extras/1b768a581e48cb106e398afe22211a35.avif?t=1785939070\" width=430 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">MEDITATIVE ENDURANCE CHALLENGE GAME!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALL YOU DO IS HOLD THE LEFT MOUSE BUTTON. LONG TIME! </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">BUT DON'T MOVE THE MOUSE ITSELF! BABY WILL FALL!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: right\">FOR HARDCORE GAMERS ONLY. VERY DIFFICULT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death has come to take Hideous Kojira-san to the Underworld. However, the tricky old bugger has tricked Death itself by grabbing onto a falling baby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now Death has no choice but to wait for the baby to be dropped, as the baby has so much to live for still!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who's going to give up first? Will Kojira-san drop the baby? Or will Death wrap it up for the day and go home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Grab the baby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Do not drop the baby.「very difficult - easy to get distracted!」</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Wait till Death clocks out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Enjoy another day of living!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALSO FEATURING A LEADERBOARD FOR THE COMPETITIVE BABY HOLDERS OF THE WORLD!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627740/extras/81dfe602d31c3fc8e8f5407b8bb50abc.poster.avif?t=1785939070\" width=158 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627740/extras/81dfe602d31c3fc8e8f5407b8bb50abc.webm?t=1785939070\" type=\"video/we